      },
      "message": "Board: claims, heartbeats, releases with proof, addressed notes, generated AGENT_CHAT.md\n\nReplaces hand-edited AGENT_CHAT.md with an append-only SQLite board\n(~/.bf/bf.sqlite): component-wise path overlap, idempotent re-claim,\n30-minute leases extended by heartbeat, STALE on expired claims, release\nwith `--proof '<cmd>'` that runs the command and records exit code,\noutput digest, changed paths and HEAD, notes addressed to an agent/claim/PR\nwith an inbox (`bf board --to me`) and a trailer on every write, writer\nidentity from the observed process tree, and an atomically regenerated\ndigest with straggler import after the end marker.\n\nPlan of record PR 5: ~/.claude/plans/please-study-the-tips-snazzy-canyon.md\n\nbf-author: claude/claude-orch\nbf-claim: AGENT_CHAT.md 2026-09-18T16:34Z\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
